213	<section id="about" class="part">
214	<h2>What this page is</h2>
215	<p>The <code>fortress-repo</code> skill holds the rules that bind every worker in the repository. This page shows each change that landed in it, as a diff with its reason, so that the curator can check what the workers are now told at any time. To reverse a change, send a comment to Claude on its item, or say so in chat.</p>
216	</section>
